(B.9 Annual Health Check-up: one preventive check-up per insured adult per policy year after the) Tj T*
(first year, at Sentinel network diagnostic centres.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION C - WAITING PERIODS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(C.1 Initial waiting period: 30 days from the first policy start date for any illness. Not) Tj T*
(applicable to accidental injuries.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(C.2 Pre-existing Disease waiting period: 36 months of continuous coverage from the first policy) Tj T*
(start date.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(C.3 Specific illness waiting period: 24 months for cataract, hernia, hydrocele, piles, fissure,) Tj T*
(fistula, sinusitis, benign prostatic hypertrophy, joint replacement unless due to accident,) Tj T*
(uterine fibroids, kidney stones, gall bladder stones, varicose veins, and tonsillectomy.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(C.4 Maternity waiting period: 24 months.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(C.5 Waiting periods already served under a previous indemnity health policy are credited on) Tj T*
(portability as per IRDAI guidelines.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION D - EXCLUSIONS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(D.1 Cosmetic or plastic surgery unless for reconstruction following an accident, burn or) Tj T*
(cancer.) Tj T*
(D.2 Dental treatment unless necessitated by an accident requiring hospitalisation.) Tj T*
(D.3 Infertility, sterility and assisted reproduction including IVF.) Tj T*
(D.4 Treatment of alcoholism, drug or substance abuse, and consequences thereof.) Tj T*
(D.5 Intentional self-injury, attempted suicide.) Tj T*
(D.6 War, invasion, nuclear, chemical or biological attack.) Tj T*
(D.7 Unproven or experimental treatments.) Tj T*
(D.8 Treatment taken outside India.) Tj T*
(D.9 Obesity and weight-control treatment unless BMI >= 40 or >= 35 with co-morbidities.) Tj T*
(D.10 Hazardous or adventure sports as a professional.) Tj T*
(D.11 Non-medical items as listed in Annexure II \(toiletries, admission kit, telephone charges,) Tj T*
(etc.\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION E - CLAIMS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(E.1 Cashless: present the health card at a network hospital. Pre-authorisation decision within) Tj T*
(2 hours of receipt of complete documents for planned admission, and within 60 minutes for) Tj T*
(emergency admission.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(E.2 Reimbursement: submit the claim form, discharge summary, original bills and receipts,) Tj T*
(prescriptions and investigation reports within 30 days of discharge. The company shall settle) Tj T*
(or reject within 30 days of receipt of the last necessary document. Interest at bank rate + 2%) Tj T*
(is payable for delays beyond 30 days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(E.3 Notification: planned hospitalisation to be intimated at least 48 hours in advance;) Tj T*
(emergency hospitalisation within 24 hours of admission.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION F - GENERAL CONDITIONS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(F.1 Free Look: the policyholder may return the policy within 30 days of receipt stating) Tj T*
(reasons, and receive a refund of premium less proportionate risk premium, medical examination) Tj T*
(costs and stamp duty.) Tj T*
ET
