(F.2 Renewal: lifelong renewability. The company shall not deny renewal except on grounds of) Tj T*
(fraud, misrepresentation or non-disclosure.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(F.3 Premium revision: premiums may be revised with prior approval of IRDAI with a notice of 90) Tj T*
(days to policyholders.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(F.4 Cancellation: the policyholder may cancel at any time by giving 15 days written notice;) Tj T*
(refund is on a short-period scale. The company may cancel on grounds of misrepresentation,) Tj T*
(fraud or non-disclosure with 15 days notice and no refund.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
